    <string name="whats_new_got_it">Got it</string>
    <string name="whats_new_body">• <b>Call Insights</b> (new!) — averages, your longest call and busiest day ever, a busy-times heatmap of when you\'re usually on the phone, top contacts by talk time, and week-over-week trends. Find it in Call durations → \"See deeper insights\"\n\n• <b>Incoming call gesture</b> — answer or decline with a Single tap (default) or a Horizontal swipe, your choice in Settings\n\n• Voicemail setup moved to the sidebar menu, Settings reorganized into clearer groups, and the message/reply screens got a cleaner, more modern look\n\n• Since 1.2.2: <b>Sleep timer</b> for calls, plus Bluetooth device switching and visual voicemail (beta) from 1.2.0</string>
